flowchart TD
    QUERY([Query string]) --> EMBED[Embed query vector]
    EMBED --> SEARCH[Chroma similarity search\ntop_k=5]
    SEARCH --> FILTER{similarity ≥ 0.7?}
    FILTER -- Yes → include entries --> INJECT[Inject as context into prompt]
    FILTER -- No matches → skip LTM --> STM_ONLY[Use short-term only]
    INJECT & STM_ONLY --> FINAL([Final context to LLM])

    CHROMA_DOWN{Chroma unavailable?} -- Yes --> STM_ONLY